   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1035,
   "src": "6b5fba00e7ba",
   "t": "Look, it's starting."
  },
  {
   "i": 1052,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1063,
   "src": "26aa1ea6ca98",
   "t": "Oh... that's pretty impressive."
  },
  {
   "i": 1070,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1079,
   "src": "2c8c34da07e2",
   "t": "Hey, those are proper fireworks."
  },
  {
   "i": 1082,
   "src": "b207a6e4e283",
   "t": "They really put on a show."
  },
  {
   "i": 1089,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1098,
   "src": "05a3600abee2",
   "t": "Tama~yaaa~!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1105,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1111,
   "src": "1afa4ff20d83",
   "t": "Huh? What's that?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1114,
   "src": "343341793cde",
   "t": "Some kind of spell?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1121,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1127,
   "src": "95946d9b5495",
   "t": "It's the trade name of a famous old\nfireworks maker."
  },
  {
   "i": 1130,
   "src": "0f4983696fa3",
   "t": "My grandpa taught me to shout it at\nfireworks."
  },
  {
   "i": 1140,
   "src": "79e1be719219",
   "t": "Kaaa~giyaaa~!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1165,
   "src": "a6610e2cbc5e",
   "t": "Summer vacation's over already..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1170,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1176,
   "src": "5f2fe648ef48",
   "t": "It went by in a flash."
  },
  {
   "i": 1186,
   "src": "ed8f8ffd12a8",
   "t": "I wonder if the {{principal|cap}} will forgive us."
  },
  {
   "i": 1191,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1197,
   "src": "1810714beb75",
   "t": "Who knows."
  },
  {
   "i": 1200,
   "src": "7c9613d256af",
   "t": "All we can do is pray to the stars."
  },
  {
   "i": 1207,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1216,
   "src": "86aa88a3bc2b",
   "t": "Shouldn't it be the Vice-Principal\nrather than the stars?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1223,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1232,
   "src": "9a03aa5cb19e",
   "t": "Right."
  },
  {
   "i": 1239,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1245,
   "src": "ce77b8427ecd",
   "t": "Anyway, it was a great summer."
  },
  {
   "i": 1248,
   "src": "d51d32eab970",
   "t": "Thrills and achievements. Totally\nsatisfied."
  },
  {
   "i": 1256,
   "src": "f7214806018a",
   "t": "From next semester, I'm not doing a\nthing."
  },
  {
   "i": 1266,
   "src": "0be30a8363f2",
   "t": "...Haha."
  },
  {
   "i": 1271,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1277,
   "src": "69ab48ff36ca",
   "t": "That's a relief to hear."
  },
  {
   "i": 1280,
   "src": "22f4b6c41a2d",
   "t": "Lately you've been acting like a\ndifferent person."
  },
  {
   "i": 1287,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1293,
   "src": "c68aa3e88303",
   "t": "Yeah. I felt really off inside too."
  },
  {
   "i": 1296,
   "src": "d0b4aebe7ecd",
   "t": "It felt wrong somehow."
  },
  {
   "i": 1304,
   "src": "c6a5c9e7992e",
   "t": "I overdid it."
  },
  {
   "i": 1307,
   "src": "b7626af4f5fd",
   "t": "The {{club}} closure, the big adventure over\nthe detector..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1315,
   "src": "60a295d0a575",
   "t": "Come to think of it... "
  },
  {
   "i": 1317,
   "src": "dd058b089d29",
   "t": "-kun, it all"
  },
  {
   "i": 1320,
   "src": "7b4c58ec1a54",
   "t": "started around when you showed up."
  },
  {
   "i": 1328,
   "src": "08d4600b399e",
   "t": "W-what, all of a sudden?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1331,
   "src": "352efe3612f7",
   "t": "Are you saying it's my fault!?"
  }
 ]
